Token lookups now go through a per-connection cache with a 5 minute TTL. Logout clears the entry, so revoked tokens stop working immediately.

```ts src/server/cache.ts
get(key: string) {
  const hit = this.map.get(key);
  if (!hit || hit.exp < Date.now()) return null;
  return hit.value;
}
```

I also added a test for expiry. All **128 tests** pass.
